ate%\"\n       }\n     }\n   ```\n4. Include a comment in a TypeScript file for [i18next-parser](https://github.com/i18next/i18next-parser) to add the message from `console-extensions.json` to your message catalog. For example:\n\n   ```tsx\n   // t('plugin__console-demo-plugin~Demo Plugin')\n   ```\n5. To update the JSON files in the `locales` folder of the plugin template when adding or changing a message, run the following command:\n\n   ```terminal\n   $ yarn i18n\n   ```\n\n**Additional resources**\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/)\n- [yarn](https://yarnpkg.com/)\n- [react-i18next localization guidelines](https://www.i18next.com/)\n- [PatternFly components](https://www.patternfly.org/components/all-components/)\n- [PatternFly’s accessibility fundamentals](https://www.patternfly.org/accessibility/accessibility-fundamentals/)\n","mdUrl":"https://dogsbay.github.io/openshift-docs-markdown/web_console/dynamic-plugin/overview-dynamic-plugin.md"} ?? undefined;
